;; A held detached worker may lose its last ordinary owner after collection.
;; Its callbackless close returns to the real release continuation, without a
;; live replacement plan. Only those private C zvals gain retiring admission.
dec $gc_worker_quiescent_retiring(pstate, nat) : bool
